    },
    "message": "Show EffectProgram intervention quantities in the PDF report\n\ncollect_report kept a fixed set of payload keys for each intervention.\nEffectProgram events put some parameters beside op instead of under\nparameters, so a report lost how many toilets, staff or evacuees were\nadded and what quantity of which resource was delivered (#160).\n\nMove the selection into intervention_details and add those quantity\nkeys, with labels for the PDF. Per-person arrival context, language,\nroutes and internal program IDs stay out of the report.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
